X-WR-CALNAME:Where Winds Meet - Version Calendar
X-WR-CALDESC:Only Where Winds Meet previews and version updates. Leaving a 
 game? On iPhone just delete that calendar. On Android\, switch OFF "show" 
 in Calendar account settings instead of tapping Delete - deleting one URL 
 subscription removes all of them.
X-WR-TIMEZONE:Asia/Shanghai
REFRESH-INTERVAL;VALUE=DURATION:PT6H
X-PUBLISHED-TTL:PT6H
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:wwm-24-release@game-version-calendar
DTSTAMP:20261102T120000Z
DTSTART:20261106T020000Z
DTEND:20261106T023000Z
SUMMARY:Where Winds Meet - New Season (Pt. 2) + Twin Spears
DESCRIPTION:China server date. The same day opens a new Weiyang City area a
 nd a new questline. Twin spears are the third new weapon style added this 
 year.\n\nAll times are Beijing time (UTC+8).\nEntries marked Estimated or 
 TBC are projected from version cycles and may shift once officially announ
 ced.
LOCATION:Where Winds Meet
CATEGORIES:Where Winds Meet
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
